{"id":"bra_utigam","lemma":"Bräutigam","pos":"noun","rank":4013,"glosses":["bridegroom (a man with regard to his wedding)"],"ipa":"/ˈbʁɔʏtɪɡam/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1b/De-Br%C3%A4utigam.ogg/De-Br%C3%A4utigam.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Bräutigams","plural":"Bräutigame","feminine":"Braut"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Bräutigam ist dreißig Jahre alt.","en":"The groom is thirty years old.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"thirty"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"old"}]},{"text":"Der Bräutigam ließ die Braut vor dem Altar stehen.","en":"The groom left the bride standing at the altar.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"altar"},{"g":"to stand"}]},{"text":"Sie dürfen die Braut küssen.","en":"You may kiss the bride.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698531","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to be allowed"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to kiss"}]},{"text":"Die Braut sah sehr schön aus.","en":"The bride looked very beautiful.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"well, beautifully"},{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Trinken wir auf die Braut!","en":"Let's drink to the bride.","words":[{"g":"to drink by mouth)"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}